                <div class="bg-green-50 p-4 rounded-2xl border border-green-100 shadow-inner">
                    <h3 class="font-black text-green-700 mb-3 text-md flex items-center">🎁 選擇 2 個獎勵</h3>
                    <div id="rewards-list" class="grid grid-cols-2 gap-2 mb-4 max-h-32 overflow-y-auto scroll-hide p-1">
